  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for enhancing farmers&apos; income through the strengthening of a sustainable agricultural environment in Mindanao, Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(High Poverty Rate Among Farmers)The project area, Mindanao, records a poverty incidence of 20.5% among individuals and 28.4% among farmers, which is significantly higher than the national average of 15.5%. The agriculture sector in this region is identified as a vulnerable livelihood group with low economic resilience due to multiple risks, including climate change, price volatility, and declining productivity. In particular, the worsening impact of climate change is projected to cause economic losses of up to 7.6% of GDP by 2030, underscoring the urgent need for targeted interventions to reduce poverty in the agricultural sector and promote regional development.1. &#xb18d;&#xbbfc;&#xc758; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xbcc0;&#xd654; &#xc801;&#xc751; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xb18d;&#xac00;&#xc758; &#xc18c;&#xb4dd;&#xc99d;&#xb300;, 2. &#xd611;&#xb3d9;&#xc870;&#xd569;&#xc758; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xbc0f; &#xc2dc;&#xc7a5; &#xc6b4;&#xc601; &#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1.1 Establishment of a Data Collection System, 1.1.2 Data Analysis and Research, 1.1.3 Development of Data-Based Climate Change Adaptation Technologies, 1.1.4 Development of a Climate Change Adaptation Agriculture Curriculum, 1.2.1 Training of Agricultural Technology Leaders, 1.2.2 Implementation of Agricultural Technology Training Programs, 1.2.3 Farm-Level Application and Monitoring Support, 2.1.1 Cooperative Management Capacity-Building Training, 2.1.2 Cooperative Business Support, 2.1.3 Expansion of Cooperative Networks, 2.1.4 Development of Young Agri-Entrepreneurs, 2.1.5 Operation of Demonstration Farms for Crop Diversification, 2.1.6 Development of Local Specialty Product Brands, 2.1.7 Establishment of Cooperative Retail Stores</narrative>
  </description>
